{"id":"n26546-1-7","stage":4,"title":"꼴찌 · 末等","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26546-1-7-1","ko":"달리기 시합에서 민준이가 제일 마지막으로 들어왔대요.","zh":"据说在跑步比赛中，敏俊是最后一个冲过终点的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"달리기","meaning":"赛跑，跑步比赛","explanation":"달리기：赛跑，跑步比赛","readings":[{"term":"달리기","audio":"/audio/4c47747ba8ec10732144.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28388","senseId":"2","lemma":"달리기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시합에서","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마지막으로","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어왔대요.","meaning":"传来","explanation":"들어오다：传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"9","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4c47747ba8ec1073","term":"달리기","zh":"赛跑，跑步比赛","audio":"/audio/4c47747ba8ec10732144.mp3","entryId":"28388","definition":"在规定距离内比试跑步速度的竞赛。","pronunciation":["달리기"]},{"id":"944bf12d99b921ad","term":"시합","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3","entryId":"13985","definition":"体育比赛等互相发挥实力决胜负。","pronunciation":["시합"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"传来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"消息、谣言、要求等被传开或流传。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c4d1d288250bed20048.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26546-1-7-2","ko":"꼴찌였다는 소리군요.","zh":"也就是说他得了最后一名啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"꼴찌였다는","meaning":"末等，垫底","explanation":"꼴찌：末等，垫底；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"꼴찌","audio":"/audio/91c400dc781b2dfd5791.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26546","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼴찌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리군요.","meaning":"声音，想法，消息","explanation":"소리：声音，想法，消息；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"4","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"91c400dc781b2dfd","term":"꼴찌","zh":"末等，垫底","audio":"/audio/91c400dc781b2dfd5791.mp3","entryId":"26546","definition":"成绩、排名等倒数第一。","pronunciation":["꼴찌"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，想法，消息","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"许多人共同的意见或传闻。","pronunciation":["소리"]}],"audio":"/audio/b93e664e7453a7a26286.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.371,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26546","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.1977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["也就是说他得了最后一名啊。","我们一起坐吧。","据说在跑步比赛中，敏俊是最后一个冲过终点的。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["也就是说他得了最后一名啊。","据说在跑步比赛中，敏俊是最后一个冲过终点的。","我们一起坐吧。"],"answer":0}]}
